    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "City living shaped by the sea, Sand House is a collection of 172 fully furnished studio, 1, 2 and 3 bedroom rental homes at the heart of the Glass Bottle waterfront in Dublin 4, moments from Grand Canal Dock, the city's Central Business District and the coast.\r\n\r\nEvery apartment is designed around modern living, with floor-to-ceiling windows and a private balcony framing views across the city, coast and mountains. Interiors are finished to a high standard throughout — a contemporary two-tone kitchen with solid worktops and integrated Neff appliances, plush furnishings curated by an interior designer, fitted wardrobes, a separate utility room with washer/dryer, and a spacious bathroom with terrazzo-effect tiling and a rain shower.\r\n\r\nLife at Sand House unfolds from the top down. Rooftop terraces invite you to dine, relax or enjoy an open-air cinema. Just below, the 15th-floor Sky Lounge offers elegant spaces for private dining and co-working, wrapped in uninterrupted 360° views of Dublin — city, coast and mountains in every direction. At ground level, a state-of-the-art gym, wellness suite with sauna, flexible co-working spaces and a private screening room complete a home designed around living well.\r\n\r\nBeyond the building, Dublin Bay, Irishtown Nature Reserve and the coast are all on your doorstep — for sea swimming, cycling and fresh air whenever you need it. With a dedicated onsite management team, secure bike storage, pet-friendly homes and an onsite Tulu rental station, every detail is considered.\r\n\r\nThis is Glass Bottle. This is home.\r\n\r\nglassbottle.ie/sand-house"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sand House isn't just apartments, it's a movement. \r\n\r\nCombining 172 meticulously designed studio, 1, 2, and 3 bedroom fully furnished rental homes with cutting-edge amenities, curated experiences, and a thriving community that celebrates living well.\r\n\r\nFrom your private terrace overlooking Dublin Bay or the city to a state-of-the-art wellness suite with sauna, every detail has been crafted for you. \r\n\r\nWhether you're powering through work in one of the many co-working spaces, hosting an intimate dinner, unwinding in our private screening room, pushing yourself in the gym or fitness studio or watching a movie on the magical rooftop terrace, Sand House delivers the lifestyle you've been waiting for. This is where contemporary living meets community.\r\n\r\nThis is Glass Bottle. This is home."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Rooftop Terrace — Sweeping 360° views of the city, coast and mountains, with an open-air cinema and space to dine, relax and gather.\r\nSky Lounge and Private Dining — A stunning space on the 15th floor that shifts from focused workdays to dinner parties and celebrations, wrapped in uninterrupted views.\r\nWellness Suite — Unwind in the onsite sauna and plunge pool, designed for a life of balance and wellbeing.\r\nGym and Fitness Studio — A fully equipped gym plus a state-of-the-art yoga and spin studio to support an active lifestyle — right on your doorstep.\r\nCo-working Spaces — Thoughtfully designed flexible workspaces and bookable offices that make working from home easy.\r\nPrivate Screening Room — Your own residents-only cinema for film nights, sports screenings and everything in between.\r\nResidents' Lounges, Library and Snugs — Beautifully designed shared spaces to relax, socialise and connect with your neighbours.\r\nPet Friendly — A home that welcomes every member of the family, four-legged ones included.\r\nOnsite Management Team — A dedicated team on hand to ensure everything runs smoothly, every day.\r\nCoastal Living on Your Doorstep — Dublin Bay, Irishtown Nature Reserve and the coast just outside, for sea swimming, cycling and fresh air whenever you need it."
      },
